# Intrilex — HTTP headers for static hosting platforms
#
# Neocities does NOT support custom HTTP headers or _headers files.
# This file is included for forward compatibility: if the frontend
# ever moves to a host that supports _headers (Netlify, Cloudflare
# Pages, Vercel, etc.), these headers will be applied automatically.
#
# The CSP <meta> tag in index.html covers most directives, but
# frame-ancestors is IGNORED in <meta> per the CSP spec — it MUST
# be delivered via an HTTP header. This file provides that header.
#
# Format: Netlify/Cloudflare Pages _headers convention
#   <path>
#     Header-Name: value

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
